 * correctly-formed emails, unique username check, assignment of allowed roles,
 * and correct audit metadata. Security policies ensure only authorized clients
 * can create moderator/administrator accounts. Relationship: users references
 * user_roles via user_role_id (UUID). The operation complements authentication
 * endpoints and supports user onboarding workflows. Error handling includes
 * duplicate entries, invalid roles, and input format errors.
