 *
 * This test verifies that the user creation API ({@link api.functional.bbs.users.post}) properly enforces validation on required fields:
 * - Invalid/nonexistent role reference (role_id)
 * - Invalid email format
 * - Invalid password constraints
 * - Invalid username constraints
 *
 * Steps:
 * 1. Fetch available user roles to select a valid role and fabricate an invalid one.
 * 2. Attempt user registration for each invalid case:
 *    a) role_id not referencing a real role
 *    b) malformatted email
 *    c) password that fails policy (e.g., too short)
 *    d) username that fails constraints (e.g., empty)
 * 3. For each case, confirm that a validation error is thrown (no need to check error details).
