 * 3. Authenticate as admin.
 * 4. As admin, soft-delete the target normal user using the eraseById endpoint.
 * 5. Verify the soft-deleted user's status reflects the appropriate value ('deleted').
 * 6. Attempt to login as the deleted user and expect failure (account should not be usable).
 * 7. (If the API supported it) Attempt to review the user's audit trail/content remains possible. (Skip if such query is not implemented.)
 *
 * Note: This test does not cover full restoration logic or content listing, as the API surface is not provided here. Only soft-delete and account status validation are tested.
 */
